#: scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ad3afe42b90c89780bcdfbc6b3a6d250aa2037c818fbf7c49db9dd35ecc4de0
#. default-sha256: de71c0b4de59cd9754d40f7adb3b81d7af030503cd3227e4c5fb4f2f750d6dca
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7271CF53_2F9D_4C71_BB5A_EFD55E3FD8B8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After discussions I had no part in, it was decided that my uncle would be the next head. "
"⟪k:1⟫That they weren’t confident I had the spine to do the job properly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他们对我这种天真的家伙要继承家业感到不安。⟪k:1⟫结果，⟪k:2⟫在商量过后，⟪k:3⟫继承人变为了叔父。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a10deec5734680e798196e10b7f7d2efa7a307096cca8e0e0d30f1a803e25c43
#. default-sha256: a3fabeba19b89e595803b9f1e6a3c706e09042d1c72d25dbb9780339464c506b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_14AA6030_BFFC_4D54_8F5F_CD1BA4D4AA3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫在我不知道的情况下，尘埃落定——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那个时候，⟪k:3⟫我感到很奇怪。⟪k:4⟫为什么他们什么都没"
"有对我说。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62a864b6a2e0e9c423d12cc431520fd47172ad3064f8cf4037493e2b4253bfb7
#. default-sha256: fbe801b98fac513d41e8078296b2085f55174c38584d3e483d8dac7122773a3f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_826116EA_6045_40AC_A4A1_DE73A200E194"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If it meant I could go on with my quiet life,⟪k:1⟫I didn’t care who they picked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果我能和现在一样安稳地生活下去……⟪k:1⟫那么，⟪k:2⟫即使继承人变了也无妨。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87edf81bf54fcb4905a102752af7bf9ad1ee1b1393806da7a677d2635a54c983
#. default-sha256: 23950a41e965df6ad1770219adf57e45809924bc271e87ab0d4f6bcc4a63a4dc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A7480C5_2579_4E5D_BD3A_355A5A2BB7BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My uncle, though, seemed to have caught on to my apathy,⟪k:1⟫which he did not take kindly to,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫恐怕，⟪k:1⟫叔父是看破了我这种性格，⟪k:2⟫又或者是我漠不关心的态度——⟪k:3⟫最终触及了叔父的逆鳞。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f1cf4e98dff4c9fb5517f41218b49381e5b32a87f7a4ea0573d3fb42221b37e
#. default-sha256: 740477325fb1dbd5af0c44ada1b9efdd1efabfdd9f2f4ebfadc3047f53c41c95
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0F9B4C2F_8D4B_457A_9E21_31B09E682CB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So this is our new home, dearest Mell!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫这里是奈莉和哥哥大人的新家呢！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38feaa87508f2b54aa0dae88133bc8e9a7a629aea6dc8236c7a0062db3e27eeb
#. default-sha256: f936bce13f82773c0ea58fb2496a5d34db99b0ef1661f312f19380767e14ae85
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C46DB12A_F1A6_4AEF_80D6_1C916DF0125C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66585ef9627b138d7a9baf9b43c11f9351940e27a162f707ab544f2f5a8f15be
#. default-sha256: 7d7c6f373f41190ef272832a3a4ccc9018e91c916f0f14ca7dee65e30df6e3bc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BA103644_E5BA_4A61_A657_15137CCE2AB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re not going to go and say you want to return home in a couple months when you realize "
"life isn’t as luxurious here as it was back there, are you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这样真的好吗？⟪k:1⟫因为，⟪k:2⟫和我一起来的话，⟪k:3⟫就表示……你再也不能拥有像在家里一样优渥的生"
"活了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 776463fa5041d8262ae8afdf4fc1f0bf5c3b4a6c8010a640c438707f576b41a7
#. default-sha256: 03dfd1b44548e2f6d08b03ee4cd3a53795fc50380159810c75a5b38567af49a8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D53E37F5_E62E_43EB_85DE_F5F5852B0380"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There’s only one thing in the whole wide world I really need."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫奈莉真正想要的东西，⟪k:2⟫是世界上唯一仅有的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b6875e0389362eb120276e1fc925d619e565606ba417f397222f57b8054d91e
#. default-sha256: f8ce3cded9ee2b0813b18f96f0f55fb6942ab0f45396824a3d59be24cb0e215d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E9C7B0D6_955F_47A6_A1B6_B3B638AA981D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe. I’m as happy as I’ve ever been.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t need all that fancy, expensive "
"stuff."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫呵呵，⟪k:2⟫奈莉现在，⟪k:3⟫就已经很幸福了。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫不需要那么优渥的条件也可以哦。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D08E366E_EA6D_46C9_9B0F_8668427BDBE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86f41075da8b4530886320661264bbec6de2b69d222c8b416816eb35fc718acd
