msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4628AC94_86B1_412F_AF1B_3E7270C71B3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……嘿嘿……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c686bcdee5b7ab225c0d2a168226501c7dc1aab72435d7461390823cf89f80d
#. default-sha256: e67df9206e8b99ce7f0b72bd9d938afaf5178e29ed6b5cadda3f7ccff7db02ba
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B77B9324_C68A_4471_972E_2BC1BEA37683"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wha— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Th-⟪k:5⟫That can’t be right...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m sure I’ve been smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫哎，⟪k:3⟫是、⟪k:4⟫是这样吗……⟪k:5⟫我一直笑着啊……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f749678bef255e91b1130269ade1e13d5fe6b86ef866c44dc7e515c2735b64c
#. default-sha256: 5967fdb9804053320c0478b16d447009060e5f1cc5d808dcfd075c2c08972a08
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_71D278E8_A4E6_4699_99AB_D18D8754EC03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m really glad you decided to come with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫谢谢你，⟪k:1⟫奈莉。⟪k:2⟫你能和我一起真是太好了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b725299df3340c50637e4826933be6c1a89ee84fd4842bb63ec2bf541fa2e1a
#. default-sha256: a2c87b9611e6228e8f529add42b14ae0d40ba1befeeb4401b7e2374e98c14564
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD72C044_BFA1_41D0_8B39_3193E6CED39F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Until that day, I had never known how good it felt to have someone who wanted me "
"in their life—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫有人视我为必需的存在。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫有人一直关注着我。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35bc245ede281c1385880d57cd1f8058969b73ef708095f9159e7ab2e8c3ed92
#. default-sha256: b87b0602df1f2fd1c18722030edbc76a120df646f66b1e38d6e780eb7c5bcfed
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_DCB637E0_5BB5_4D40_BF49_0311E5C87F0E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫who saw me for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我还是第一次知道，⟪k:1⟫这样的事情，⟪k:2⟫会让人如此开心。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3631c88b887158bb9044708a96f3cb2f1b49a7b6c67e17b334b1a6fe3c150ce
#. default-sha256: 1fcac5e7246b20a5ee118374121e21e8e24ceaee75e88befa618be059583510b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78516612_89A0_4842_AE37_8A5A650138DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was hardly prince material—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wasn’t strong or handsome or regal enough for that—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽然我完全不像王子……⟪k:1⟫活得十分不堪而卑微——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd0341b6d0651ba1209c512d6b2a89d34878cac6a538f337b6fb340f0fd2c55e
#. default-sha256: b8e9bd4cecee93b80e3487059d25940dec7d2ff820fd9bdd9b88b33136fb2bb8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_75447CBB_525D_40EE_A675_182108C12D34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I’m staying home because I want to be with you as much as possible.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「现在我想留在奈莉的身旁，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫如果去外面工作的话不就见不到你了吗」。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b5a861f6c17fd578cee255e6beb27e1af6e09c1659a8599a515170f9624bfe6
#. default-sha256: 1c561b01b92b17c19aba05a06ab319dc41b9269f6de8cbfedb4dddace07c2ad9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8D5AB42A_967E_45D3_B838_B7700592D49C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Welcome home, dearest Mell! What did you buy today?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫啊，⟪k:4⟫欢迎回来啊哥哥大人！⟪k:5⟫今天买了什么？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 367332d713c9d2299a21438b3fb6cbdb1d306c2e061df207c18762e2a73c9702
#. default-sha256: 803e66c8fc9b67df4684e1152d747e2fe4bed333e1c0a4bd31349867d9c65993
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8D84C66_4B84_4F88_B226_A876B8F45AD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wow! I’ve never seen one so up close before!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are we going to keep it as a pet?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哇啊，⟪k:2⟫奈莉，⟪k:3⟫还是第一次在这么近的地方看鸡先生呢！⟪k:4⟫我们要拿这只鸡怎么办呢？"
"⟪k:5⟫养它当宠物吗？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B6DAF2C0_14E5_41D0_9248_6F5891F8439C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ffa988d4e9cf2f37e084b0c25fc3768c73f43c2b254e9e1b2b28f0d33dd32ff1
