msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re... ⟪k:4⟫going to cook it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎……⟪k:2⟫要把它……做成菜吗？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_46FE45DB_48F9_4B11_A5B7_E9CFA7AAD163
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1417daa946742a8819e3a9daf3f0128c2aafb3edb50b1a839bde1cfdf128322
