#: scenario8:scenario8_38DA7167_1618_42C5_AF7D_F30CD4EF91C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed7d037971b498ba748a95be30b55933e4c95170b84ac8f4fe8cc76decbfc79f
